OL,3,GNEWSALegal challenge over military base
OL,4,Aasylum plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe early stages of a legal challenge
OL,7,Fopposing plans to build an asylum
OL,8,Fcentre on Ministry of Defence (MoD)
OL,9,Fland has been launched.
OL,11,FThe Home Office is proposing to provide
OL,12,Faccommodation for up to 1,256 men at a
OL,13,Fsite near Bicester, Oxfordshire.
OL,15,FLawyers representing Bicester
OL,16,FCountryside and Communities community
OL,17,Finterest company have now taken the
OL,18,Ffirst formal step towards a possible
OL,19,Fjudicial review.
